word\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_4068aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Ring\"><img alt=\"Life Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Ring_d8e154.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Ancient Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ancient_Shield_0b428c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Treasure island map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Treasure_island_map_9e632b.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places and Loot <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Treasure Island</b> is a small island to the south-west in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Shattered%20Isles\">Shattered Isles</a>.\n</p><p>The historic rumours about buried treasure from <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirates\">pirate</a> raids have made this island very popular with treasure seekers and diggers. Over time, the island has become one large excavation site.\n</p><p>Any visitor will need to walk carefully to avoid the many holes and rubble that remain from the countless diggers that have been there before.\n</p><p>The island has become very commercialized. There are no creatures on the surface of the island except for the occasional <a href=\"#/wiki/Seagull\">Seagull</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvas</a>, some wandering <a href=\"#/wiki/Crab\">Crabs</a> and many <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a>.\n</p><p>It costs 200 gp to travel to the island and 50 gp to return. Before some Update it was 500 gp to get back, which caused many people to get stuck on the island as they didn't know the cost to get back was that high.\n</p><p>There is treasure on the island, though. There are two chests filled with gold, but they are not possible to reach.\n</p><p>You can also buy a <a href=\"#/wiki/Treasure%20Map\">treasure map</a> there for 1,000 gp, but most people question its authenticity. There is a consensus among treasure seekers that you will need a real <a href=\"#/wiki/Treasure%20Map%20%28Pirate%29\">pirate treasure map</a> to find treasure on the island, if any actually exists there.<br/>\n</p><p>Each time you want to access the caverns you have to do the <a href=\"#/quest/treasure-island-quest\">Treasure Island Quest</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Treasure Island NPCs (8 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Barney\">Barney</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Barney\"><img alt=\"Barney\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Barney_8d830c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Treasure Hunter</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">North on <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Treasure Island</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Waverider\">Captain Waverider</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Waverider\"><img alt=\"Captain Waverider\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Captain_Waverider_f2614a.gif\" width=\"122\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Ferryman</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32344,32855,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32344, 32855, 7)</a>), <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Treasure Island</strong> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32132,32913,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32132, 32913, 7)</a>) and Treasure Hunt Island (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32045,32931,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32045, 32931, 7)</a>)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Danlon\">Danlon</a></td><t